[33.687363, "o", "  \u001b[38;2;108;112;134mTips: Add a QWEN.md file to give Qwen Code persistent project context.\u001b[39m\r\n  ●︎ Auto mode enabled.\r\n       An LLM classifier evaluates each tool call — safe actions auto-approve,\r\n       risky ones are blocked. Exit: Shift+Tab or /approval-mode default.\r\n  ●︎ Read context files: ../../../../AGENTS.md, AGENTS.md, ~/.qwen/output-language.md\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;203;166;247m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;203;166;247mhello\u001b[39m\r\n  ●︎ Extensions changed on disk. Run /reload-plugins to apply updates.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;203;166;247m◆︎\u001b[39m Hello! How can I assist you with your project today?\r\n  ●︎ Qwen Code update available! 0.22.0 → 0.22.1\r\n    The update will be installed after you exit this session.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;203;166;247m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;203;166;247mExplain what is Qwen Code\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;203;166;247m◆︎\u001b[39m Qwen Code is an AI-powered coding assistant designed to help software engineers efficiently write, refactor, test, and manage\r\n    code. It integrates with your development environment, understands your project context, and supports safe, convention-aware\r\n    code modifications, project setup, troubleshooting, and documentation. Qwen Code leverages advanced language models and tool\r\n    integrations to automate repetitive coding tasks and streamline the software development workflow.\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;137;180;250m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;2;137;180;250m> \u001b[39mNow, I can navigat\u001b[48;2;212;212;212m \u001b[49m​\r\n\u001b[38;2;137;180;250m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;203;166;247m➜ acme-dashboard · GPT-4.1 · 131.1k Context 14.5% used\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;2;137;180;250mAuto mode\u001b[38;2;108;112;134m (shift + tab to cycle)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[4A\u001b[21G\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
